  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;set of observation, the total observations are <math><mi>‘</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>’</mi></math><br />and the first observation of <math><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> set is<br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math><br />Sum of all the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> observations in the <math><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math> set<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Mean <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Hence, for <math><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;Mean <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>170</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>85</mn></math></p>",
